    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a surrounded beast and move to avoid the attacks of the beast tide. Keep upgrading to gain stronger abilities, mowing down enemies like grass, and become the legendary divine beast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique way of attacking: the Blue Dragon represents celestial phenomena, the Black Tortoise represents defense, the Vermilion Bird represents fire, the White Tiger represents killing, the Qilin represents lightning, and the Taotie represents devouring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synergy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By choices,construct different schools of magics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few enemies have special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/extras/e002df582a09e7192ebdd8c88d24db7d.avif?t=1754707713\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spiritual pet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/extras/ccc517b40f996d7aab121a0744dd853d.avif?t=1754707713\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter a strange egg on the way, breaking it will grant you a spirit pet. Take it and break through the siege together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an initial survival mode mode and an endless mode set up for challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The scale of the beast tide will increase over time. To survive, you must enhance your strength as soon as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Pick up experience balls to level up, and they won't disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7There are some enemies with special abilities. If you don't deal with them properly, you'll be caught off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7If you are lucky, you will encounter all kinds of rare treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The &quot;DaoFa&quot; that can be constructed are limited. It's advisable to give it more thought when making a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7You can hide in the grass for a short time. If you can't defeat the beast tide, hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The duration of each game in the survival mode is within 20 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven and Earth are impartial, treating all things as straw dogs. How many sentient beings seek to become deities and attain immortality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a unique beast surrounded by a tide of beasts. Only by surviving can you have a chance to become a legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a surrounded beast and move to avoid the attacks of the beast tide. Keep upgrading to gain stronger abilities, mowing down enemies like grass, and become the legendary divine beast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique way of attacking: the Blue Dragon represents celestial phenomena, the Black Tortoise represents defense, the Vermilion Bird represents fire, the White Tiger represents killing, the Qilin represents lightning, and the Taotie represents devouring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synergy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By choices,construct different schools of magics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few enemies have special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/extras/e002df582a09e7192ebdd8c88d24db7d.avif?t=1754707713\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spiritual pet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759180/extras/ccc517b40f996d7aab121a0744dd853d.avif?t=1754707713\" width=512 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter a strange egg on the way, breaking it will grant you a spirit pet. Take it and break through the siege together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an initial survival mode mode and an endless mode set up for challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The scale of the beast tide will increase over time. To survive, you must enhance your strength as soon as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Pick up experience balls to level up, and they won't disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7There are some enemies with special abilities. If you don't deal with them properly, you'll be caught off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7If you are lucky, you will encounter all kinds of rare treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The &quot;DaoFa&quot; that can be constructed are limited. It's advisable to give it more thought when making a choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7You can hide in the grass for a short time. If you can't defeat the beast tide, hide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7The duration of each game in the survival mode is within 20 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven and Earth are impartial, treating all things as straw dogs. How many sentient beings seek to become deities and attain immortality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as a unique beast surrounded by a tide of beasts. Only by surviving can you have a chance to become a legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Yi Shou Shan Hai&quot; is a casual roguelike game that takes Chinese mythological animals as its themes.Move to avoid getting hurt.Through choices during level-up, enhance the magics of the character and cultivate different &quot;DaoFa&quot; schools.Survive the beast tide and eventually become the legend!",
